      "writtenOn": "2026-11-19T13:25:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think the prefix matters much as long as it conveys that people should not use it without a good reason. `temporary_` would be ok, `rollout_` seems cryptic to me.\n\n`compatibility_level \u003d $NUMBER` is a good idea in general but will require much more changes to GN internals. I don\u0027t think it\u0027s worth it for this specific change. It would be nice to introduce that in a separate set of CLs though so it can be leveraged in the future. Wdyt?",
      "parentUuid": "a1427ca9_e06b3942",
      "revId": "26f835965b583fe0b887d4db86c183922bf3c41b",
      "serverId": "c360c8e5-7aa8-3905-a7a0-810934766dac"
